     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Two blue horse-shaped seats turn the Horse See Saw into a pretend ride for small children. Each child sits astride a horse and holds on as they rock up and down. It is sized for the 3 to 6 years Key User Group and seats two. The horse shape gives younger children a seat they can grip with their knees, which helps them feel steady. Allow 7' x 2'3\" for the see saw itself and 11' x 6'3\" for its safe play area. Colours are Knight Blue and Play Orange. It suits a play school, nursery or society toddler area. Galvanised pipe and roto-moulded horses are covered for 3 years against manufacturing defects. Ask us for a quote and layout drawing."
     }
    ]
   }
